---
// src/components/home/WhyWeExistSection.astro
// Section 03: Why We Exist — Data Urgensi Sosial & Rantai Transformasi Nilai
---

<section class="why-exist-section" id="why-we-exist">
  <div class="why-exist-container">
    <!-- Header Pendek & Padat -->
    <div class="why-exist-header text-center reveal-on-scroll">
      <span class="editorial-kicker">KENAPA GLOBAL VILLAGE FUND?</span>
      <h2 class="why-exist-title">
        Kebaikan yang Tumbuh Menjadi Ekosistem.
      </h2>
      <p class="why-exist-lead">
        Kebaikan tidak berhenti pada satu bantuan. Ia dapat tumbuh menjadi pendidikan, kompetensi, kemandirian, dan kebermanfaatan yang dirasakan lebih luas.
      </p>
      <p class="why-exist-sub">
        Global Village Fund hadir sebagai wadah kebaikan dan kolaborasi untuk mendukung penguatan ekosistem pesantren—menghubungkan pendidikan, pengembangan kompetensi, lingkungan, kemandirian, dan kebermanfaatan sosial.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 4 Metrik Kunci Mendatar (Compact, Clean Stats Row) -->
    <div class="stats-compact-grid reveal-on-scroll delay-100">
      <div class="stat-compact-card">
        <span class="stat-val">1</span>
        <h3 class="stat-name">Pilot Project</h3>
        <p class="stat-info">Pesantren Integratif Holistik Skill Village Islamic School di Jonggol Bogor.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="stat-compact-card">
        <span class="stat-val">±3 Ha</span>
        <h3 class="stat-name">Kawasan Pengembangan</h3>
        <p class="stat-info">Lahan terpadu masjid, ruang vokasi, greenhouse, & agriteknologi ramah lingkungan.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="stat-compact-card">
        <span class="stat-val">FAST</span>
        <h3 class="stat-name">Character Development</h3>
        <p class="stat-info">Pembentukan karakter luhur Fathonah, Amanah, Shiddiq, dan Tabligh.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="stat-compact-card">
        <span class="stat-val">∞</span>
        <h3 class="stat-name">Potensi Kebermanfaatan</h3>
        <p class="stat-info">Pahala jariyah abadi dan dampak kemandirian yang terus berlipat ganda.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .why-exist-section {
    position: relative;
    padding: 72px 0 80px;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--gvf-surface-200, #e2e8f0);
  }

  /* typeui principle: 1280px standard container */
  .why-exist-container {
    max-width: 1240px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 32px;
  }

  /* Compact Header */
  .why-exist-header {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto 48px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .editorial-kicker {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--gvf-blue-vibrant, #0969da);
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .why-exist-title {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 3.2vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--gvf-navy-dark, #061829);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
  }

  .why-exist-lead {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #1e293b;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }

  .why-exist-sub {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #64748b;
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  /* Compact 4 Stats Horizontal Row */
  .stats-compact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    padding-top: 36px;
    border-top: 1px solid #edf2f7;
  }

  .stat-compact-card {
    background: #f8fafc;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 24px 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;
  }

  .stat-compact-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    border-color: #cbd5e1;
    background: #ffffff;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
  }

  .stat-val {
    font-size: 2.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    color: var(--gvf-blue-vibrant, #0969da);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-family: 'Golos Text', sans-serif;
  }

  .stat-name {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--gvf-navy-dark, #061829);
    margin-bottom: 6px;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .stat-info {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #64748b;
    margin: 0;
  }

  @media (max-width: 1024px) {
    .stats-compact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      gap: 16px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .why-exist-section {
      padding: 56px 0 64px;
    }

    .why-exist-container {
      padding: 0 20px;
    }

    .why-exist-header {
      margin-bottom: 36px;
    }

    .stats-compact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 14px;
    }
  }
</style>
